                                "sense_id": "7c4150bc-cfd4-3a08-a879-35571fa14dcd",
                                "text": "Examples of this will be found in the arms of Madden [\"Sable, a hawk or, trussing a mallard proper, on a chief of the second a cross botonny gules\"], and in the crests of Graham, Cawston, and Yerburgh."
